WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.340
San Marcos, Kapitulo 2

00:30.000 --> 00:32.100
Paralitiko na ipanda ken kwana.

00:32.880 --> 00:34.220
Ngimga po iti kaadu

00:34.220 --> 00:36.080
ti tao, di da

00:36.080 --> 00:38.260
may asideg ken Jesus ti masakit.

00:38.840 --> 00:39.960
Winangwangan da nga rod

00:39.960 --> 00:41.740
ti ateb iti nga tuwen Jesus

00:41.740 --> 00:44.120
sa daimbaba ti paralitiko

00:44.120 --> 00:45.720
anak kaida iti papag.

00:46.600 --> 00:47.760
Idi makita ni Jesus

00:47.760 --> 00:49.940
ti pamatida, kinunana

00:49.940 --> 00:50.920
iti paralitiko.

00:51.640 --> 00:54.020
Anak ko, napakawanan

00:54.020 --> 00:55.680
dagit ibasbasol mo.

00:56.420 --> 00:57.960
Sadyay, ada nga

00:57.960 --> 00:59.600
at tuktugaw ti sumagmamano

00:59.600 --> 01:01.340
ama maestro iti linteg.

01:02.000 --> 01:03.320
Kinunada iti nakimda,

01:04.060 --> 01:05.480
Apay akasta ti sa o

01:05.480 --> 01:07.740
daytoy atao, maibuso riti

01:07.740 --> 01:09.160
Diyos ti sasawin na.

01:09.680 --> 01:11.900
Nilayang apu Diyos ti makapakawan

01:11.900 --> 01:12.680
iti basol.

01:13.360 --> 01:15.380
Amu adagos ni Jesus ti ada

01:15.380 --> 01:17.600
iti panunod da, ket kinunana.

01:18.300 --> 01:20.080
Apay akasta ti pampanunod

01:20.080 --> 01:20.420
niyo.

01:21.600 --> 01:23.700
Anya tinalaklakang isa o iti

01:23.700 --> 01:24.860
daytoy aparalitiko.

01:26.140 --> 01:26.980
Napakawanan

01:26.980 --> 01:28.440
dagit ibasbasol mo.

01:28.440 --> 01:29.980
When no?

01:31.000 --> 01:31.780
Bumangon ka.

01:32.860 --> 01:34.060
Alaam taidam

01:34.060 --> 01:35.240
ket magnaka.

01:36.100 --> 01:37.680
Panatnakak ngarod kada kayo.

01:38.360 --> 01:39.420
Ati anak ti tao

01:39.420 --> 01:41.960
at da pannakabalin na dito'y daga

01:41.960 --> 01:44.120
ama makawan kadagiti

01:44.120 --> 01:45.060
ibasbasol.

01:45.780 --> 01:47.380
Kinunana iti paralitiko.

01:48.200 --> 01:49.340
Ibilin ko ken ka.

01:50.140 --> 01:50.980
Bumangon ka.

01:51.900 --> 01:53.300
Bagkatam taidam

01:53.300 --> 01:55.040
ket agawid kan.

01:55.040 --> 01:57.060
Iti imatang daamin,

01:57.060 --> 01:58.940
Bumangon ti lalaki.

01:59.600 --> 02:01.020
Binagkat na ti iddana

02:01.020 --> 02:03.280
ket nagdadaras anagawid.

02:04.000 --> 02:05.280
Nagsidao daamin

02:05.280 --> 02:07.640
ket indaydayaw da ti Diyos.

02:08.440 --> 02:10.020
Di kampay nakaimatang

02:10.020 --> 02:11.060
ti kastoy apasamak.

02:13.460 --> 02:14.100
Kinunada.

02:14.820 --> 02:16.140
Nagsublimanin ni Jesus

02:16.140 --> 02:17.600
itiigid ti danaw

02:17.600 --> 02:18.360
ti Galilea.

02:18.980 --> 02:21.300
Napankenkwana dagiti adu at at tao

02:21.300 --> 02:22.940
ket insuro na ida.

02:23.840 --> 02:24.740
Idi magmagna

02:24.740 --> 02:26.640
na kita natin may isang

02:26.640 --> 02:27.960
nagsingsingir itibwis

02:27.960 --> 02:29.180
ni Levi

02:29.180 --> 02:30.680
nga anak ni Alfeo.

02:31.300 --> 02:32.500
Agtugtugaw ni Levi

02:32.500 --> 02:33.600
iti ofisina na

02:33.600 --> 02:35.640
apagbayadan itibwis.

02:36.440 --> 02:37.280
Surutan na.

02:37.720 --> 02:39.300
Kinuna ni Jesus.

02:40.300 --> 02:41.420
Timakder ni Levi

02:41.420 --> 02:43.040
ket simurot kenkwana.

02:44.160 --> 02:45.420
Idi mangmangan ni Jesus

02:45.420 --> 02:46.600
itibalay ni Levi

02:46.600 --> 02:48.540
na kilanglang kenkwana

02:48.540 --> 02:49.900
ken dagiti adalan na

02:49.900 --> 02:51.740
ti adu ngagsingsingir itibwis

02:51.740 --> 02:52.980
kenta tao

02:52.980 --> 02:54.020
amanagbasol.

02:54.820 --> 02:55.160
Ngamin,

02:55.920 --> 02:56.580
adu dagiti

02:56.580 --> 02:57.880
simurot kenkwana

02:57.880 --> 03:00.000
at daso magmamano

03:00.000 --> 03:01.720
ang maestro itilinteg

03:01.720 --> 03:03.140
akamkaming tigrupo

03:03.140 --> 03:04.040
dagiti farisyo.

03:04.800 --> 03:05.640
Idi makita da

03:05.640 --> 03:07.180
ang makipampangan ni Jesus

03:07.180 --> 03:08.500
kadagiti managbasol

03:08.500 --> 03:10.040
ken agsingsingir itibwis

03:10.040 --> 03:11.660
sinaludso da

03:11.660 --> 03:12.860
kadagiti adalan na.

03:13.540 --> 03:15.000
Apay akalang lang na

03:15.000 --> 03:16.860
dagiti agsingsingir itibwis

03:16.860 --> 03:19.060
ken dagiti managbasol?

03:19.820 --> 03:20.920
Nang ngegida ni Jesus

03:20.920 --> 03:21.760
kit kinunana

03:21.760 --> 03:23.980
saan adagiti nasalon

03:23.980 --> 03:25.120
at timakasapol

03:25.120 --> 03:26.180
itimangagas?

03:26.580 --> 03:27.480
Nudiket

03:27.480 --> 03:28.760
dagiti masaksakit.

03:30.020 --> 03:30.740
Diyak imay

03:30.740 --> 03:32.180
tapno ayabak

03:32.180 --> 03:33.140
dagiti nalintag

03:33.140 --> 03:33.720
at at tao.

03:34.860 --> 03:35.660
Imayak

03:35.660 --> 03:37.360
tapno ayabak

03:37.360 --> 03:38.680
dagiti managbasol.

03:39.440 --> 03:40.340
Iti na minsan

03:40.340 --> 03:41.800
agay ayonar

03:41.800 --> 03:42.560
dagiti adalan

03:42.560 --> 03:43.840
ni Juan Amamunyag

03:43.840 --> 03:45.360
ken dagiti farisyo

03:45.360 --> 03:47.220
na panti sumagmamano

03:47.220 --> 03:47.880
at at tao

03:47.880 --> 03:48.640
kinesos

03:48.640 --> 03:50.200
kit sinaludso da.

03:50.920 --> 03:51.800
Apay agayonar

03:51.800 --> 03:52.560
dagiti adalam

03:52.560 --> 03:54.920
ni Juan Amamunyag

03:54.920 --> 03:55.880
ken dagiti adalan

03:55.880 --> 03:56.940
dagiti farisyo

03:56.940 --> 03:58.560
ngam dagiti adalam

03:58.560 --> 03:59.040
saan?

03:59.800 --> 04:00.980
Simungbat ni Jesus

04:00.980 --> 04:02.760
Mabalin aya

04:02.760 --> 04:03.740
adi mangan dagiti

04:03.740 --> 04:05.140
sanga ili itipaboda?

04:06.260 --> 04:06.780
Manganda

04:06.780 --> 04:08.920
saan da nga agayonar

04:08.920 --> 04:10.020
no adda tinobyo

04:10.020 --> 04:10.900
itisidong da?

04:12.060 --> 04:13.660
Ngam dumten to ti tsyempo

04:13.660 --> 04:15.200
ama ipanaw tinobyo

04:15.200 --> 04:15.940
kadakwada.

04:16.740 --> 04:17.360
Isuntun

04:17.360 --> 04:18.560
tipan agayonar da.

04:19.360 --> 04:20.400
Saan nga itakop

04:20.400 --> 04:21.400
ti baro alupot

04:21.400 --> 04:23.060
itidaan apagananay?

04:24.060 --> 04:25.660
Tanukom senti na itakop

04:25.880 --> 04:27.400
dumakdakkel

04:27.400 --> 04:28.160
tipigis.

04:29.380 --> 04:30.400
Saan mat nga ikabil

04:30.400 --> 04:31.380
ti baro nga arak

04:31.380 --> 04:32.720
itidaan asupot

04:32.720 --> 04:33.280
alalat?

04:34.120 --> 04:34.800
Tabat takan

04:34.800 --> 04:35.420
ti arak

04:35.420 --> 04:36.120
ti supot

04:36.120 --> 04:37.680
kit agpadada

04:37.680 --> 04:38.540
amadadael.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.240
Ikarga kit

04:40.240 --> 04:41.300
diti baro nga arak

04:41.300 --> 04:42.480
itibaro asupot

04:42.480 --> 04:43.140
alalat.

04:44.560 --> 04:46.220
Itimay sangal daw

04:46.220 --> 04:47.020
apanaginan na

04:47.020 --> 04:48.620
magmagnanesos

04:48.620 --> 04:49.880
ken dagiti adalan na

04:49.880 --> 04:51.000
itikataltalonan

04:51.000 --> 04:51.800
anamulaan

04:51.800 --> 04:52.560
ititrigo.

04:53.240 --> 04:54.360
Bayat tipan nagnada

04:54.360 --> 04:55.640
nagurus

04:55.640 --> 04:56.660
dagiti adalan na

04:56.660 --> 04:57.580
kadagiti dawa

04:57.580 --> 04:58.280
ititrigo.

04:58.940 --> 04:59.540
Sinalodso

04:59.540 --> 05:00.500
dagiti farisyo

05:00.500 --> 05:01.260
kinesos,

05:02.020 --> 05:02.600
Kitaem,

05:03.780 --> 05:04.760
aping aramidan

05:04.760 --> 05:05.680
dagiti adalam

05:05.680 --> 05:06.720
itimaisalungasing

05:06.720 --> 05:07.260
itialdo

05:07.260 --> 05:07.980
apanaginan na?

05:08.660 --> 05:09.980
Insumbat nesos,

05:10.920 --> 05:11.420
Diyo pay

05:11.420 --> 05:12.220
ayanabasa

05:12.220 --> 05:13.560
itinaramid ni David

05:13.560 --> 05:14.420
ken dagiti

05:14.420 --> 05:15.300
tattao na

05:15.300 --> 05:16.160
idimabisinda?

05:17.700 --> 05:18.920
Simrek ni David

05:18.920 --> 05:19.560
itibalay

05:19.560 --> 05:20.100
ti Diyos

05:20.100 --> 05:21.300
sanangan

05:21.300 --> 05:22.320
ititinapay

05:22.320 --> 05:23.080
anaidaton

05:23.080 --> 05:23.640
ti Diyos.

05:24.820 --> 05:25.480
Napasamak

05:25.480 --> 05:25.960
daytoy

05:25.960 --> 05:27.000
idiniabyatar

05:27.000 --> 05:27.700
ti kangatuan

05:27.700 --> 05:28.200
apadi.

05:29.420 --> 05:30.720
Itipaglintagan tayo.

05:31.820 --> 05:32.540
Dagiti lang

05:32.540 --> 05:33.180
papadi

05:33.180 --> 05:34.140
ti mapalubusan

05:34.140 --> 05:34.700
amangan

05:34.700 --> 05:35.600
itidaita

05:35.600 --> 05:36.300
atinapay.

05:37.660 --> 05:38.060
Ngem

05:38.060 --> 05:39.120
nangan ni David

05:39.120 --> 05:40.680
ket inikan

05:40.680 --> 05:41.140
napay

05:41.140 --> 05:42.280
dagiti tattao na.

05:43.080 --> 05:43.780
Naaramid

05:43.780 --> 05:44.400
ti aldaw

05:44.400 --> 05:45.220
apanaginana

05:45.220 --> 05:46.100
ngaagpaay

05:46.100 --> 05:47.160
itipagimbagan

05:47.160 --> 05:47.620
ti tao.

05:48.700 --> 05:49.420
Saan

05:49.420 --> 05:50.280
anaaramid

05:50.280 --> 05:50.760
ti tao

05:50.760 --> 05:51.760
ngaagpaay

05:51.760 --> 05:52.520
itialdaw

05:52.520 --> 05:53.300
apanaginana?

05:54.300 --> 05:54.760
Ngarod,

05:55.480 --> 05:56.380
ti anak

05:56.380 --> 05:56.940
ti tao,

05:57.900 --> 05:58.300
iso

05:58.300 --> 05:58.880
ti apo,

05:59.880 --> 06:00.660
uraypay

06:00.660 --> 06:01.580
ti aldaw

06:01.580 --> 06:02.440
apanaginana.

